%N A400986 a(n) = max_{1 <= k < n} (k + tau(k)) - n, where tau(k) is the number of positive divisors of k.
%H A400986 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A400986/b400986.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 2..10000</a>
%H A400986 Thomas F. Bloom, <a href="https://www.erdosproblems.com/647">Erdős Problem 647</a>, Erdős Problems.
%F A400986 a(n) = max_{1 <= k < n} A062249(k) - n.
%F A400986 a(n) >= A000005(n-1) - 1 >= 0.
%o A400986 (PARI) a(n) = vecmax(vector(n-1, k, k+numdiv(k)))-n;
%Y A400986 Cf. A000005, A062249, A087280.
%K A400986 nonn,new
